This product is a VK (ВКонтакте) messaging channel plugin for Hermes Agent.
It is an independent Python implementation written against the Hermes platform-plugin
contract (Bots Long Poll API inbound, messages.send outbound).

It was written after studying the openclaw-vk channel plugin, whose transport flow,
message shapes and keyboard payloads served as the reference:

    openclaw-vk — https://github.com/pfrankov/openclaw-vk
    Copyright 2026 Pavel Frankov
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (their LICENSE carries that notice).

The Apache-2.0 text in this repository's LICENSE differs from theirs in one line only:
the copyright owner in the appendix, which applies the license to this work.

No source code from openclaw-vk (TypeScript/Node) is included or linked here; the
implementation, the markdown→format_data renderer, the media pipeline and the tests are
original work for the Python/Hermes runtime. Changes relative to the reference design:
a full re-implementation rather than a port of files — the long-poll loop, the
table/quote-aware markdown renderer, VK's per-item format_data allowlist, the upload
pipeline (photos/docs/audio_message) and the shared Hermes button convention
(clarify / exec-approval / slash-confirm) all follow Hermes' plugin contract.

